:''For the Cat Unit, see [[Brainwashed Axe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Axe Cat]]. For the weaker boss, see [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]].''
'''Malevolent Dark Cat''' is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy that appears in [[Hyperberserker (Merciless)|The Malevolent Axe]]. It was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Malevolent Dark Cat
|image = E 662.png
|first appearance = [[Hyperberserker (Merciless)|The Malevolent Axe]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This durable and somewhat fast enemy boasts very high DPS and rapid attacks at 360 range. Its [[Curse]] ability makes sure nothing stands a chance, and when it reaches 34% health, it [[Strengthen|Strengthens]] by 100%. Its very high health is effectively doubled by a [[Shield]] that blocks status effects and regenerates for every knockback; these completely sweep its [[Surge Attack#Counter-Surge|Counter-Surge]] under the carpet. Like all enemy [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Dark Cat]] variants, it isn't a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy.

==Strategy==
Malevolent Dark Cat's very high DPS and Curse ability means the only consistent meatshield to use would be [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]] due to its high HP, [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]], and [[Resistant|Resistance]] to Aku.

To block its progress, [[Talents|talented]] [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] can [[Knockback|knockback]] Malevolent Dark Cat, giving you some breathing room. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] brings excellent DPS and [[Slow|slow]] debuffs, but you will have to be careful of Malevolent Dark's Counter-Surge and Shield. [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Extinction Phono]] is also an excellent attacker and debuffer, though they may have some of Uril's problems- but at less risk, due to the former's high range and weaker [[Surge Attack#Mini-Surge|Mini-Surges]].

